# Shared look for every dcvm demo. Each tape starts with `Source docs/demo/_style.tape`.
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 8
Set Padding 18
Set Margin 24
Set MarginFill "#0E7490"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
